<title>USA: Seagate says sets two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Seagate says sets two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTS VALLEY, Calif. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagate Technology, Inc. said on Thursday its board of directors approved a two-for-one stock split, effective in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split will increase the number of shares of Seagate common stock outstanding from approximately 107,000,000 shares to 214,000,000 shares.</p>
<p>The record date for the stock split will be November 11, 1996.</p>
<p>Around November 26, 1996, the transfer agent will mail certificates to shareholders of record representing one additional share for each share held on this record date.</p>
</text>
